// CotSC Batch 18 - extracted original English dialogue for nashkel_extras.d
// Keep existing @ numbers stable when translating.
@1 = ~Don't even think about brawling or you're out!~
@2 = ~My job is to keep thieves out. Don't mind me. Please, pick whatever you like. We've got a huge assortment of items.~
@3 = ~This is a reason being a thief is going down the drain nowadays. They just have to hire guards on every step of the way.~
@4 = ~Then find a more honorable profession, lass. The world will reward you for it.~
